c expected: unsat
c
c An empty clause followed by the unit clause {1}.  An empty clause is false, so
c the formula is refuted whatever else is in it; z3 agrees.
c
c It answered sat because the leading 0 was read as a literal of the same clause
c rather than as the terminator of an empty one, so the empty clause vanished.
p cnf 1 2
0 1 0
